class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">chevron_right</span></a></li><li tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" class=\"faqs-category ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"baggage\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"faq-btn\"><span class=\"catergory-text ng-star-inserted\">Baggage</span><!----><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">chevron_right</span></a></li><li tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" class=\"faqs-category ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"refund\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"faq-btn\"><span class=\"catergory-text ng-star-inserted\">Refund</span><!----><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">chevron_right</span></a></li><li tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" class=\"faqs-category ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"complaints\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"faq-btn\"><span class=\"catergory-text ng-star-inserted\">Complaints</span><!----><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">chevron_right</span></a></li><li tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" class=\"faqs-category ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"guests with disability\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"faq-btn\"><span class=\"catergory-text ng-star-inserted\">Guests with Disability</span><!----><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">chevron_right</span></a></li><li tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" class=\"faqs-category ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"retiree program\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"faq-btn\"><span class=\"catergory-text ng-star-inserted\">Retiree Program</span><!----><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">chevron_right</span></a></li><li tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" class=\"faqs-category ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"government ticket (govclick)\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"faq-btn\"><span class=\"catergory-text ng-star-inserted\">Government Ticket (GovClick)</span><!----><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">chevron_right</span></a></li><li tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" class=\"faqs-category ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"alfursan store\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"faq-btn\"><span class=\"catergory-text ng-star-inserted\">AlFursan Store</span><!----><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">chevron_right</span></a></li><li tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" class=\"faqs-category ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"saudia business\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"faq-btn\"><span class=\"catergory-text ng-star-inserted\">Saudia Business</span><!----><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">chevron_right</span></a></li><li tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" class=\"faqs-category ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"seats\"><a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"faq-btn\"><span class=\"catergory-text ng-star-inserted\">Seats</span><!----><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">chevron_right</span></a></li><!----></ul></div><div class=\"faqs-list ng-star-inserted\"><!----><h3 class=\"search-result-caption ng-star-inserted\"> Booking </h3><!----><!----><mat-accordion class=\"mat-accordion ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-27 selected-category mat-expanded mat-expansion-panel-spacing ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-41 mat-expanded mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-9\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-9\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-41\"><mat-panel-title class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-star-inserted\">What is a booking reference?</mat-panel-title><!----></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-41 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><!----><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-27 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-9\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-9\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-27\"><mat-panel-description class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-description ng-star-inserted\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>A booking reference, also known as a Passenger Name Record (PNR), is a unique identifier for your reservation. It typically consists of six alphanumeric characters (e.g., B8XYZ6) or a 12-digit numerical characters; and can be found in your booking confirmation email or on your e-ticket. This code allows you to access and manage your booking details, such as checking flight status, making changes, or checking in online.</p></p><!----></mat-panel-description><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-28 selected-category ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-42 mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-10\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-10\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-42\"><mat-panel-title class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-star-inserted\">What should I do if I entered the passenger's name incorrectly?</mat-panel-title><!----></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-42 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><!----><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-28 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-10\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-10\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-28\"><mat-panel-description class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-description ng-star-inserted\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>If you notice a minor misspelling in the passenger's name, please contact the seller's agent (if you purchased the ticket from a travel agency) or Saudia's city ticketing office and/or call centre (if you purchased the ticket directly from Saudia) to request a name correction. Official documentation will be necessary for significant name changes, such as those resulting from marriage or divorce. A small fee will be imposed for name corrections.</p></p><!----></mat-panel-description><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-29 selected-category ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-43 mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-11\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-11\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-43\"><mat-panel-title class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-star-inserted\">How many passengers can I book in one reservation through Saudia channels?</mat-panel-title><!----></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-43 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><!----><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-29 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-11\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-11\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-29\"><mat-panel-description class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-description ng-star-inserted\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>A single reservation can hold up to nine passengers, including a combination of adults and children. Furthermore, the system allows the addition of one infant per adult passenger. If you're traveling with more than nine people, please contact the nearest Saudia office or travel agency partners for further assistance.</p></p><!----></mat-panel-description><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-30 selected-category ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-44 mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-12\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-12\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-44\"><mat-panel-title class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-star-inserted\">What is the time limit for issuing tickets after booking?</mat-panel-title><!----></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-44 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><!----><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-30 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-12\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-12\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-30\"><mat-panel-description class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-description ng-star-inserted\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>The time limit for ticket issuance depends on the chosen fare, route and point of sale. It is advisable to issue tickets immediately in order to guarantee your reservation without delay and prevent the risk of missing out.</p></p><!----></mat-panel-description><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-31 selected-category ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-45 mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-13\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-13\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-45\"><mat-panel-title class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-star-inserted\">Do all other airlines accept e-tickets?</mat-panel-title><!----></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-45 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><!----><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-31 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-13\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-13\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-31\"><mat-panel-description class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-description ng-star-inserted\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>Yes, e-tickets are the standard form of ticketing in the airline industry and are accepted by all major airlines worldwide. They offer a convenient and secure way to manage your travel without the need for physical paper tickets</p></p><!----></mat-panel-description><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-32 selected-category ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-46 mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-14\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-14\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-46\"><mat-panel-title class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-star-inserted\">What is the validity of the e-ticket?</mat-panel-title><!----></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-46 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><!----><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-32 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-14\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-14\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-32\"><mat-panel-description class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-description ng-star-inserted\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>The validity of an e-ticket depends on the fare rules associated with your booking. Typically, tickets are valid for one year from the date of issue. However, certain fares may have different validity periods or travel restrictions. It's essential to review the fare conditions at the time of purchase or consult with the Saudia for specific details.</p></p><!----></mat-panel-description><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-33 selected-category ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-47 mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-15\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-15\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-47\"><mat-panel-title class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-star-inserted\">What is the required information to complete a booking?</mat-panel-title><!----></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-47 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><!----><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-33 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-15\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-15\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-33\"><mat-panel-description class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-description ng-star-inserted\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>To ensure a smooth booking process, please provide the following details:</p>\n• Passenger Information: (Full name as per passport or national ID, Date of birth, Nationality, Gender).\n<p>• Contact Details: (Valid email address, Active mobile phone number).</p>\n<p>Travel Documents:</p>\n• For international flights: Passport number, country of issue, and expiry date.\n<p>• For domestic flights: National ID or Iqama number, place of issue, and expiry date.</p></p><!----></mat-panel-description><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-34 selected-category ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-48 mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-16\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-16\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-48\"><mat-panel-title class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-star-inserted\">How do I book my flights?</mat-panel-title><!----></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-48 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><!----><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-34 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-16\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-16\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-34\"><mat-panel-description class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-description ng-star-inserted\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>You can conveniently book your flights through the following methods:</p>\n<p>• Online Booking: through Saudia’s web or app.</p>\n<p>• Saudia offices or partner travel agencies.</p></p><!----></mat-panel-description><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-35 selected-category ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-49 mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-17\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-17\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-49\"><mat-panel-title class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-star-inserted\">What is the correct way to add passengers’ names?</mat-panel-title><!----></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-49 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><!----><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-35 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-17\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-17\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-35\"><mat-panel-description class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-description ng-star-inserted\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>It’s always advisable to enter the passenger’s name exactly as shown in your travel document. Accurate name entry is crucial to prevent issues during check-in or boarding.</p>\n<p>If the first/family name is not mentioned in your passport, you can always use FNU to be added in that field.</p>\n<p>It’s also important to avoid translation tools upon entering the name as they may introduce errors.</p></p><!----></mat-panel-description><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-36 selected-category ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-50 mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-18\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-18\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-50\"><mat-panel-title class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-star-inserted\">How can I apply a promotional code during booking?</mat-panel-title><!----></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-50 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><!----><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-36 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-18\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-18\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-36\"><mat-panel-description class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-description ng-star-inserted\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>Start Booking: Visit the Saudia website or app, enter your travel details, and proceed to booking.</p>\n<p>Enter Promo Code: Look for the \"Promotional Code\" field, enter the code, and continue.</p>\n<p>Verify Discount: Ensure the discount is applied to your total fare before payment.</p>\n<p>Complete Booking: Review and confirm your details to finalize the reservation.</p>\n \n<p>Note: Promo codes have specific validity periods, applicable routes/classes, and terms. Always check the conditions before applying.</p></p><!----></mat-panel-description><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-37 selected-category ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-51 mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-19\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-19\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-51\"><mat-panel-title class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-star-inserted\">What are the available services at Saudia website &amp; Mobile App?</mat-panel-title><!----></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-51 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><!----><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-37 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-19\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-19\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-37\"><mat-panel-description class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-description ng-star-inserted\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>Saudia digital channels provide reservation &amp; booking/rebooking tickets services along with purchasing excess baggage, seats and WI-FI vouchers, information about flights’ schedule, issuing and cancelling boarding pass, and ticket refunds. The website also displays the latest updates and news related to Saudia, travel offers and new destinations.</p></p><!----></mat-panel-description><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-38 selected-category ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-52 mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-20\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-20\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-52\"><mat-panel-title class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-star-inserted\">Can I book for an unaccompanied minor through Saudia website?</mat-panel-title><!----></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-52 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><!----><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-38 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-20\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-20\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-38\"><mat-panel-description class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-description ng-star-inserted\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>The unaccompined minor needs so many arrangements throught the booking, departing and arriving airports. Therefore, it's not possible to book via the digital channels, while it's available through Saudia's offices.</p></p><!----></mat-panel-description><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-39 selected-category ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-53 mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-21\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-21\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-53\"><mat-panel-title class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-star-inserted\">Do I have to provide a visa for the country I wish to travel to before booking?</mat-panel-title><!----></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-53 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><!----><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-39 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-21\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-21\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-39\"><mat-panel-description class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-description ng-star-inserted\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p>No, the visa requirement vary depending on the desired destibation. It's the passenger's responsibilties to ensure those requirements before travelling.</p></p><!----></mat-panel-description><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-40 selected-category ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-54 mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-22\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-22\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-54\"><mat-panel-title class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-star-inserted\">Is there any price difference bewteen the buying a ticket from the web/App compared to prices on offices?</mat-panel-title><!----></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-54 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><!----><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-40 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-22\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-22\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-40\"><mat-panel-description class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-description ng-star-inserted\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\"><p> Saudia offers special fares, discounts, and promotional offers to its passengers, primarily through digital channels. These offers include some customised promo codes, which cannot be offered in it's sales offices.</p></p><!----></mat-panel-description><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><!----></mat-accordion><!----><!----></div><!----></div></section><!----></div></section></app-jss-enhanced-faqs><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder></div></section></app-jss-faqs><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-scripts class=\"ng-star-inserted\"></app-jss-scripts><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}